Improves your capacity to see invisible foes by [+19, +24, +29, +32, +35 (TL1-5; MAG 100)] and to see through stealth by [+19, +24, +29, +32, +35 (TL1-5; MAG 100)].  Additionally you have a [6%, 15%, 21%, 24%, 27% (TL1-5)] chance to recover from a single negative status effect each turn.

Sense abilities will scale with your Magic stat.
